<title>UK: NordLB sets 1.5 billion French franc seven-yr bond.</title>
<headline>NordLB sets 1.5 billion French franc seven-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead manager Caisse des Depots et Consignations and Caisse Nationale de Credit Agricole.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    17.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.074   PAY DATE    17.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.499    SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.75 PCT 2003 OAT / 8.25 PCT 2004 OAT -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
